  | [examples](https://github.com/isaackogan/TikTokLive/tree/master/examples "examples") | [examples](https://github.com/isaackogan/TikTokLive/tree/master/examples "examples") | [feat: add Flask + SSE web UI example](https://github.com/isaackogan/TikTokLive/commit/cee829824aad3f2112481b0860e0ffa5dceb7691 "feat: add Flask + SSE web UI example  Adds a small service.py (Flask) that connects a TikTokLiveClient in a background thread and streams Comment/Gift/Like events to the browser over Server-Sent Events, plus an index.html feed that renders them live with newest-first ordering and timestamps.") | 2 months agoJul 4, 2026 |
