  ## Repository files navigation
  
  # TikTok LIVE API for Python: Real-Time Livestream Events (Unofficial)
  
  [Permalink: TikTok LIVE API for Python: Real-Time Livestream Events (Unofficial)](https://github.com/isaackogan/TikTokLive#tiktok-live-api-for-python-real-time-livestream-events-unofficial)
  
  TikTok LIVE API (TikTokLive) is the #1 TikTok LIVE client for **Python**. Connect to any [TikTok LIVE](https://www.tiktok.com/live) stream and receive **real-time chat messages, gifts, likes, follows, shares, viewer counts, battles, and more** using just a creator's `@unique_id`. No login, no credentials or app are required.
  
  TikTokLive is the definitive third-party Python library for reading the TikTok LIVE websocket, building TikTok chat bots, gift trackers, live stream overlays, alerts, and analytics tools.
  
  [![Discord](https://camo.githubusercontent.)](https://discord.gg/N3KSxzvDX8)![Live TikTok LIVE API connections](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/5d471c47b64e4fc83394d3094d5cc8e7a81b5147580d89a38257b64dea5ffdbc/68747470733a2f2f6170692e65756c657273747265616d2e636f6d2f616e616c79746963732f70697073)![TikTokLive PyPI downloads](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/6352af3d46fdeba29aea9c4136eddda9dbcec7330db93cbee8ba4834a7de90cb/68747470733a2f2f706570792e746563682f62616467652f74696b746f6b6c697665)![TikTokLive GitHub stars](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a1c34d6278f6e4714468c9878b0301fbc05bb8bde44d7c8e2f70b77da2230473/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f73746172732f69736161636b6f67616e2f54696b546f6b4c6976653f7374796c653d666c617426636f6c6f723d303237346235)![TikTokLive GitHub forks](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0d0450acd081888fd6dba1ff45cd0e57dfe40f156659bf129fb04a6b41d8e701/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f666f726b732f69736161636b6f67616e2f54696b546f6b4c6976653f7374796c653d666c617426636f6c6f723d303237346235)![TikTokLive open issues](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/ff61f22c3f93952f3f36b0b4ba3993bbdfb3ecbcca3bb5ff18101722fead9662/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6973737565732f69736161636b6f67616e2f54696b546f6b4c697665)
  
  > **Note:** This is **not** a production-ready API. It is a reverse engineering project. Use the [WebSocket API](https://www.eulerstream.com/websockets) for production by [Euler Stream](https://www.eulerstream.com/).
  
  ## What Can You Build With the TikTok LIVE API?
  
  [Permalink: What Can You Build With the TikTok LIVE API?](https://github.com/isaackogan/TikTokLive#what-can-you-build-with-the-tiktok-live-api)
  
  - **TikTok live chat readers** and chat bots that respond to comments in real time
  - **Gift trackers and donation alerts** for TikTok LIVE streamers (with streak handling)
  - **OBS overlays and stream widgets** driven by live TikTok events
  - **TikTok LIVE analytics**: viewer counts, likes, follows, battle (PK) scores
  - **Moderation tools** that react to deleted messages and room events
  - **Text-to-speech (TTS) readers** and interactive livestream games
  
