  ### `streamEnd`
  
  [Permalink: streamEnd](https://www.npmjs.com/package/tiktok-live-connector#streamend)
  
  Triggered when the live stream gets terminated by the host. Will also trigger the [`disconnected`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/tiktok-live-connector#disconnected) event.
  
